    - target: {fileID: 3211400053206962048, guid: e4119c6baa724c24f95007a2b2eb7237, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueObjects.Array.data[2]._dialogueText
      value: "The formula, \u0394 = b\xB2 - 4ac, is the discriminant for the quadratic
        equation that determines the nature of the roots."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3211400053206962048, guid: e4119c6baa724c24f95007a2b2eb7237, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueObjects.Array.data[3]._dialogueText
      value: "If \u0394 > 0, there are 2 distinct real roots."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3211400053206962048, guid: e4119c6baa724c24f95007a2b2eb7237, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueObjects.Array.data[4]._dialogueText
      value: "And if \u0394 = 0, there\u2019s 1 real root (double root)."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3211400053206962048, guid: e4119c6baa724c24f95007a2b2eb7237, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueObjects.Array.data[5]._dialogueText
